abstract: >
  SZL Holdings — Doctrine v11 (749 declarations / 14 axioms / 163 sorries, kernel
  c7c0ba17). Locked-proven = exactly 8 {F1,F4,F7,F11,F12,F18,F19,F22}. Λ unconditional
  uniqueness = Conjecture 1 (machine-checked FALSE); conditional Theorem U is axiom-free.
  Khipu BFT safety = Conjecture 2 (Wave23 conditional agreement lemma proven). Thesis v8
  (canonical; supersedes v6/v7) unifies methodological lineages — Sherman Morgan constrained
  propulsion optimization, Stewart collision/EOS/angular-momentum diagnostics,
  Lindblad/GKS/Baumgratz-Cramer-Plenio open-quantum coherence, and Byzantine quorum safety —
  with full attribution to original authors. Three machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (Wave24
  coherence-monotone strict decay, Wave25 constructive Kleene least-fixed-point, Wave26 its
  unconditional ω-continuous strengthening) are merged to main at EXPERIMENTAL/CI-green tier
  and NEVER join the locked 8. Two further PROPOSED order-/analysis-theoretic backbones merged
  today — Allodial AI order theory (lutar-lean PR #229) and the coherence→entanglement capacity
  bound (lutar-lean PR #230) — are likewise EXPERIMENTAL-tier, prove nothing about Λ (stays
  Conjecture 1), and add nothing to the locked 8. SLSA L1+L2 attested, L3 roadmap. Trust never 100%.
